# Forum Posts & Replies API Test

### Get posts for a thread
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/forum-posts/thread/{{threadId}}

### Get replies for a post
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/forum-posts/replies/{{postId}}

### Create a new post (comment)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/forum-posts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": "This is a great discussion! I have similar experiences.",
  "threadId": "{{threadId}}"
}

### Create a reply to a post
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/forum-posts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": "I agree with your point! Here's my perspective...",
  "threadId": "{{threadId}}",
  "parentId": "{{postId}}"
}

### Get a specific post with replies
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/forum-posts/{{postId}}

### Like/unlike a post
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/forum-posts/{{postId}}/like

### Update a post
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/v1/forum-posts/{{postId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": "Updated my comment with more details..."
}

### Delete a post
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/v1/forum-posts/{{postId}}
